2. DUAL-GRANT EXECUTION MODEL
================================================================================

2.1 GRANT I — PERPETUAL FREE DECOMPRESSION & VERIFICATION RIGHT
              (ZERO VENDOR LOCK-IN GUARANTEE)
Licensor hereby grants Licensee an irrevocable, perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive,
royalty-free right to execute the official unmodified Software binaries to read,
inspect (O(1) header telemetry), memory-map (zero-copy mmap), verify cryptographic
integrity (SHA-256), and decompress, untranscode, or extract any container file
generated by BAGUET (.bgt, .bgtu, .bgtt, .bgtd, .bgtp, .bgts, .bgtv, .bgttile, .bgtpr)
at any scale, 100% offline, without requiring an active commercial subscription or
BGTL1 license token.

Even if a commercial subscription expires or is cancelled, Licensee retains the
unrestricted perpetual right to decompress, extract, and audit all previously
compressed data forever.

2.2 GRANT II — COMMUNITY FREEMIUM & COMMERCIAL PRODUCTION SCALE (BGTL1)
(a) Community Tier (Free Execution): Subject to the restrictions in Section 3,
    Licensee may execute the Software free of charge for compression, testing,
    and AI memory evaluation within the technical boundaries and operational
    quotas defined for the Community tier in Soilore Tech's official commercial
    documentation (https://baguet.soilore.com).
(b) Commercial Tiers (Pro / Growth / Enterprise): Execution beyond Community
    tier boundaries — including scaled multi-core throughput, production AI
    tensor and compute-in-compressed-space pipelines, Custom Prior, AES-256
    encryption, or enterprise cluster deployment under the Pro, Growth, or
    Enterprise tiers — requires a valid, cryptographically signed Ed25519
    license token (BGTL1) issued by Soilore Tech for the applicable tier,
    subject to the limits published in the official commercial plan terms.

